
# Borden finite-duration rectangular-region source task package

This package upgrades the previous Borden point-source task into a more difficult SE-Bench task.

Main design change:
- Reuse the existing Borden grid, hydrogeological parameters, monitoring-file format, and SE-Bench packaging pattern.
- Modify the inverse problem from an effective point source to a finite-duration rectangular-region source.
- Modify scoring so that easy format/method/prior checks add up to at most 15 points; hidden monitoring prediction dominates the score.

See `FILE_STATUS.md` for exactly which files are unchanged, modified, or newly added.
